wcnt - Wav Composer Not Toilet
==============================

wcnt is a text file based non-interactive modular audio system intended
for the production of WAV audio files. The user writes a text file
containing wcnt module definitions, and wcnt processes the file to
produce an audio file.

Wcnt has over 80 modules providing functionality for synthesis,
sequencing, sampling, routing, grouping, duplication, and effects (via
a limited subset of LADSPA plugins).

wcnt is available at https://github.com/jwm-art-net/wcnt

Please see the INSTALL file for build instructions, and dependencies.

The examples directory contains over 40 examples of usage.



